          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for holistic, integrative care and a whole-person intake to help you feel better.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#0f1724; /* deep indigo */\\n      --bg2:#07263b; /* tealish night */\\n      --accent1:#8ee3c1; /* mint */\\n      --accent2:#ffd57e; /* warm gold */\\n      --muted:#cbd5e1;\\n      --card:#091026cc;\\n      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --max-width:1080px;\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n      color:var(--muted);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;line-height:1.45;\\n      background-attachment:fixed;\\n    }\\n    /* decorative SVG pattern (embedded) */\\n    .pattern-wrap{\\n      position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.12;mix-blend-mode:screen;z-index:0;\\n    }\\n    header{position:relative;z-index:3;max-width:var(--max-width);margin:24px auto;padding:18px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:var(--accent1)}\\n    .brand .mark{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent1),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#042022;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:#fff}\\n\\n    main{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:var(--max-width);margin:12px auto;padding:28px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}\\n    @media (max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand .mark{width:46px;height:46px}}\\n\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);backdrop-filter: blur(6px);}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--accent1);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.6px;font-size:13px}\\n    h1{color:#fff;margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n\\n    /* contact form card */\\n    .side-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:#93a3b7}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent1),var(--accent2));color:#052024;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .small{font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* sections below hero */\\n    .sections{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px}\\n    @media (max-width:980px){.sections{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .card h3{margin-top:0;color:#fff}\\n    ul.clean{padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-right:6px}\\n\\n    footer{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:24px auto;color:var(--muted);padding:18px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    a.cta{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    /* small diagnostic matrix */\\n    .symptoms{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\\n    .symptoms label{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}\\n\\n    .price-flag{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#07263b55,#071a2b55);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--accent2);font-weight:700;display:inline-block}\\n\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#9aa7b6;margin-top:10px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <!-- Subtle custom SVG pattern. Also a standalone asset at assets/img/pattern.svg is expected. -->\\n    <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8ee3c1\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\" />\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffd57e\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.10\\\" />\\n        </linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"/>\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 60 C30 30 90 30 120 60 C90 90 30 90 0 60 Z\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"#07263b\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\" />\\n        </pattern>\\n        <filter id=\\\"grain\\\"><feTurbulence baseFrequency=\\\"0.8\\\" numOctaves=\\\"1\\\" stitchTiles=\\\"stitch\\\" result=\\\"t\\\"/><feColorMatrix type=\\\"saturate\\\" values=\\\"0\\\"/></filter>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mark\\\">HM</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"/index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Reach out — thoughtful care</div>\\n        <h1>Let's meet the whole you</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Start with a conversation. We listen to symptoms in the context of sleep, stress, digestion, movement and emotional life — then co-create a gentle plan that honors your pace.\\n        This is educational, integrative care, not a promise of cure.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"sections\\\" aria-hidden>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>How contact helps</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Tell us what brought you here and a few practical details so our first conversation is focused and useful.</p>\\n            <ul class=\\\"clean\\\">\\n              <li>Quick symptom snapshot</li>\\n              <li>Best times for a consult</li>\\n              <li>Relevant medical history</li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>What to expect</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Initial intake, personalized plan, optional labs or referrals. Follow-ups are scheduling checkpoints.</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><span class=\\\"pill\\\">Intake 60–75m</span><span class=\\\"pill\\\">Plan & resources</span></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>Accessibility</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Telehealth and local sessions in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Short notes and resources after visits to help you practice between appointments.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"price-flag\\\">Starting at $120</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">New patient intake fees and packages are listed on the Fees page.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <p class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">We do not promise cures. Our approach is educational and whole-person focused; individual responses vary. For urgent medical concerns, please call emergency services or your primary care provider.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"side-card\\\">\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"reason\\\">Reason for contact</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"new_patient\\\">New patient intake</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"follow_up\\\">Follow-up / review</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"lab\\\">Discuss labs</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"general\\\">General question</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"symptoms\\\">Brief description</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"symptoms\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"5\\\" placeholder=\\\"What's your main concern? (stress, sleep, digestion, low energy, inflammation...)\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin:10px 0\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Check items that apply (optional)</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"symptoms\\\">\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"s[]\\\" value=\\\"sleep\\\" /> Sleep</label>\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"s[]\\\" value=\\\"digestion\\\" /> Digestion</label>\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"s[]\\\" value=\\\"stress\\\" /> Stress</label>\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"s[]\\\" value=\\\"inflammation\\\" /> Inflammation</label>\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"s[]\\\" value=\\\"energy\\\" /> Low energy</label>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted small\\\">or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent1);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"muted small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">By contacting us you consent to receive communications about appointments and care. We treat your information respectfully; not for emergency use. For urgent care call local emergency services.</div>\\n        </form>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Plan / intake outline section (distinct voice and order) -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"padding:18px\\\">\\n        <h3>Intake & early plan — what happens next</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">If you request an intake, we will:</p>\\n        <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li>Review the contact note before meeting to focus our time.</li>\\n          <li>Begin a whole-person intake: sleep, digestion, movement, stress, relationships, and medication context.</li>\\n          <li>Co-create a gentle plan that includes education: micro-habits, targeted nutrition or lifestyle suggestions, and follow-up timing.</li>\\n          <li>Offer optional labs or referrals as educational tools; these are discussed case-by-case.</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- micro-habits section -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:start\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3>Micro-habits: small shifts</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Tiny, repeatable actions often matter more than big changes. Try one for two weeks and notice.</p>\\n        <ul class=\\\"clean\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li>30 seconds of diaphragmatic breathing on waking.</li>\\n          <li>Add one vegetable at lunch and dinner.</li>\\n          <li>Walk 6 minutes after a meal to support digestion.</li>\\n          <li>Set a 30-minute wind-down before sleep (screen-free).</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3>When to reach out sooner</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Contact us if symptoms intensify, new worrying symptoms develop, or mood/energy shifts significantly. This page is not a substitute for emergency care.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Pricing teaser and CTA -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3>Fees & practicals</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Standard rates vary; a clear fee schedule is on the Fees page. Insurance acceptance and self-pay options are discussed during booking. Sliding scale may be available depending on capacity.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">View fees & packages</a>\\n          <span style=\\\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);\\\">or <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent1)\\\">reserve a slot</a></span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- final CTA -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px;text-align:center\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">Ready to begin?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">Schedule a conversation with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — small steps, steady support.</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent1);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"muted\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"/approach.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent1);text-decoration:none\\\">Our method</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // small enhancements\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      // basic client-side validation / user feedback\\n      var name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();\\n      var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();\\n      if(!name || !email){\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        alert('Please provide your name and an email so we can respond.');\\n      }\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page for the holistic / integrative medicine site (layoutFamily: clinic_modern, voiceFamily: mystic_modern).\\n\\nWhat this file contains:\\n- contact.html: A standalone contact/connect page that includes the required section pack elements in a contact-focused order: hero, diagnostic snapshot (symptom checklist), plan/intake outline, micro-habits, pricing teaser, and a final CTA.\\n\\nDesign notes & behavior:\\n- Visuals rely on CSS gradients, glass-like cards, and a custom inline SVG pattern. There is an expectation that a separate unique SVG asset exists at assets/img/pattern.svg for other chunks; the page includes an embedded SVG for immediate visual richness and progressive enhancement.\\n- Navigation labels vary from other pages (Home, Offerings, Concerns, Method, Fees, About, Book, Connect) to satisfy subtle variation rules.\\n- The language avoids guarantees, emphasizes education and whole-person care, and includes an explicit disclaimer about not promising cures and directing to emergency services if needed.\\n\\nForm & placeholders:\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} (adjust as needed). Placeholders in the page include:\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n  - {{TAGLINE}}\\n  - {{PHONE}}\\n  - {{EMAIL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n  - {{CITY}}\\n  - {{STATE}}\\n  - {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n  - {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n\\nAccessibility & responsive design:\\n- Uses semantic form controls and labels.\\n- Responsive grid collapses to a single column at narrow widths.\\n\\nIntegration guidance:\\n- Ensure server-side handling for the form endpoint ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}) or wire the form to your contact management/email workflow.\\n- Confirm that an assets/img/pattern.svg file is present in the project to match the unique SVG background requirement across the bundle.\\n- Update fee text and sliding scale statements on /pricing.html to match actual practice policies.\\n\\nLicense & content policy:\\n- Content is educational and non-promissory; do not alter disclaimers that relate to medical urgency or guaranteed outcomes.\\n\\nIf you need this page adapted to accept a third-party scheduling widget or to integrate with a CRM (Zapier, Make, or direct API), tell me which provider and I will add the embed/snippet.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
